    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <title>Converge</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div
      style=" display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; padding: 32px"
    >
      <nav style="display: flex; flex-direction: row; gap: 16px">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
        <a href="mailto:nikhil.satiani@gmail.com">Contact</a>
      </nav>
      <div style="max-width: 720px;">
        <h1>Converge's Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p><strong>Effective Date: </strong>14th Aug, 2024</p>

        <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>
          Welcome to Converge ("we," "our," or "us"). This Privacy Policy
          explains how we collect, use, and protect your information when you
          use our Android or Web application ("the App"). We respect your
          privacy and are committed to safeguarding any data that is collected
          through the App.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          Our App does not require you to create an account or provide any
          personal information. However, we do collect certain non-personal data
          for analytical purposes to help us improve the App and provide a
          better user experience. The data we collect includes:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Region Information:</strong> The general geographic location
            of your device (e.g., country or region).
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Screen Views and Clicks:</strong> Data on which screens you view
            and the buttons or links you click within the App.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Device Information:</strong> Information about your device such
            as device model, operating system version, and screen resolution.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          All data collected is anonymous and is not linked to any individual
          user.
        </p>

        <h2>3. How We Collect Information</h2>
        <p>
          We use Google Analytics to automatically collect and analyze the
          above-mentioned data when you use the App. Google Analytics may use
          cookies and similar technologies to track and analyze user
          interactions with the App.
        </p>

        <h2>4. How We Use the Collected Information</h2>
        <p>The data collected is used to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Understand how users interact with the App.</li>
          <li>Improve the functionality and user experience of the App.</li>
          <li>Identify and resolve potential technical issues.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>5. Sharing of Information</h2>
        <p>
          We do not share the collected data with third parties, except as
          required by law or as part of using Google Analytics. Google Analytics
          may share aggregated, non-personally identifiable information with
          other Google services.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Data Security</h2>
        <p>
          We take reasonable measures to protect the data collected through the
          App from unauthorized access, alteration, or destruction. However,
          please be aware that no method of data transmission or storage is 100%
          secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>
          Our App uses Google Analytics, a service provided by Google LLC.
          Please refer to Google's Privacy Policy to understand how they handle
          your data: <a
            href="https://policies.google.com/privacy"
            target="_blank">Google Privacy Policy</a
          >.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will
          be posted within the App, and the "Effective Date" will be updated
          accordingly. We encourage you to review this Privacy Policy
          periodically to stay informed about how we are protecting your
          information.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or the
          data practices of our App, please email us at <strong
            >nikhil.satiani@gmail.com</strong
          >
        </p>

        <h2>10. Consent</h2>
        <p>
          By using the App, you consent to the collection and use of information
          as described in this Privacy Policy.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
